      <title>Political Corruption: New Laws Are the Only Way to Stop It</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-24/political-corruption-new-laws-are-the-only-way-to-stop-it</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">6928c32d8f071d3ad582a9e7</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:00:05 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>If you think President Donald Trump’s administration has a corruption problem, you are not alone: Even many Republicans are worried. But if you think the way to address it is simply to prosecute the offenders, you are sadly mistaken: As recent events illustrate, it will take new laws to bring the wrongdoers to justice.</description>
