      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-24/election-deniers-on-the-ballot-in-2026-don-t-deserve-to-win</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">7f39786e31092fe2f9dfa5d1</guid>
