      <description>President Donald Trump did not win the 2020 presidential election, but there are 193 candidates in 41 states on the November ballot who won’t reject his “Big Lie” that he did. Half of all Republicans still believe his falsehoods, and few candidates are willing to publicly counter them.</description>
